9c121","lat":null,"lng":null,"location":"〒150-0041 東京都渋谷区神南２丁目１−１","radius":null,"repeat_yearly":false,"start_at":"2026-11-26T09:00:00+00:00","status":"published","thumbnail_url":null,"title":"MAZZEL 2nd Fan Meeting -Play at the MUZEUM Vol.2-（大阪）","title_en":"MAZZEL 2nd Fan Meeting -Play at the MUZEUM Vol.2-[Osaka","sub_title":"OPEN 17:00 / START 18:00","updated_at":"2026-07-21T05:21:15.689441+00:00","link_url":null,"event_category":{"id":"b7ff4399-c3f1-4c78-8c2b-49e95f621695","title":"ライブ","title_en":"LIVE"},"event_artists":[{"id":"61035ac4-c23d-4562-aa4e-1c3d36461aeb","artist":{"name":"MAZZEL","id":"4b8a49df-863f-46ad-b1b0-dd4af432ab75"}}],"event_artist_member_lineups":[]}, {"artist_id":"4b8a49df-863f-46ad-b1b0-dd4af432ab75","campaign_tag":null,"content":"<p>RAN 映画出演</p><p>映画『ワンダンス』</p><p><br></p><p>ダンサーからも熱く支持をされ昨年にはテレビアニメも放送され話題を呼んだ、単行本累計発行部数 110 万部突破「月刊アフタヌーン」（講談社）に連載中の珈琲氏による漫画『ワンダンス』の実写映画（草場尚也監督）が 2026年11月27日(金)に全国公開が決定。</p><p><br></p><p>MAZZEL RAN の出演をぜひスクリーンでご覧ください。</p><p><br></p><p>▼詳細はこちら</p><p><a href=\"https://happinet-phantom.com/wandance/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://happinet-phantom.com/wandance/</a></p>","content_en":"<p>RAN Appears in a Movie</p><p>The movie *One Dance*</p><p><br></p><p>With a passionate following among dancers and a TV anime adaptation that aired last year to great acclaim, the manga’s total print run has surpassed 1.1 million copies.The live-action film adaptation (directed by Naoya Kusaba) of the manga *One Dance* by Kōhī, currently serialized in *Monthly Afternoon* (Kodansha), is set for nationwide release on Friday, November 27, 2026.</p><p><br></p><p>Be sure to catch MAZZEL RAN’s performance on the big screen.</p><p><br></p><p>▼Click here for details</p><p><a href=\"https://happinet-phantom.com/wandance/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://happinet-phantom.com/wandance/</a></p>","created_at":"2026-07-22T04:56:31.421045+00:00","digital_gift_available":false,"digital_gift_end_at":nu